---
.title = "LLMD quickstart",
.description = "Serve a model and send your first chat request.",
.date = .date("2026-11-17T00:00:00"),
.layout = "content.shtml",
---
Choose where LLMD will run, select a checkpoint and model source, then use the
generated commands on that host. See [Model compatibility]($link.page('llmd/models'))
for published recipes.

```=html
<div class="llmd-launch" data-llmd-launch>
  <div id="lfm3-fp8-metal"></div>
  <div id="lfm3-fp8-cuda"></div>
  <div id="lfm3-fp8-rocm"></div>
  <div id="lfm3-oneapi"></div>
  <div id="lfm3-tpu"></div>
  <div id="lfm3-furiosa"></div>
  <div id="qwen3-8-27b-fp8-metal"></div>
  <div id="qwen3-8-27b-cuda"></div>
  <div id="qwen3-8-27b-rocm"></div>
  <div id="qwen3-8-27b-oneapi"></div>
  <div id="qwen3-8-27b-tpu"></div>
  <div id="gemma-4-31b-it-cuda"></div>
  <noscript><p>The example below uses Apple Silicon. Enable JavaScript to select other run targets or use the <a href="https://zml.ai/llmd/#try-it">published launch commands</a>.</p></noscript>
  <div class="llmd-launch-layout">
    <form class="llmd-launch-settings" aria-labelledby="llmd-launch-settings-heading" data-pagefind-ignore hidden>
      <h2 id="llmd-launch-settings-heading">Configure launch</h2>
      <div class="llmd-launch-recipe">
        <div class="llmd-launch-field">
          <label for="llmd-launch-backend">Run on</label>
          <select id="llmd-launch-backend" name="backend" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-backend-hint">
            <option value="metal">Apple Silicon</option>
            <option value="cuda">NVIDIA GPU</option>
            <option value="rocm">AMD GPU</option>
            <option value="oneapi">Intel GPU</option>
            <option value="tpu">Google TPU</option>
            <option value="furiosa">Furiosa RNGD</option>
          </select>
          <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-backend-hint">Choose the hardware of the machine that will serve the model.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="llmd-launch-field llmd-launch-checkpoint">
          <label for="llmd-launch-checkpoint">Checkpoint model</label>
          <select id="llmd-launch-checkpoint" name="checkpoint" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-checkpoint-hint">
            <option>LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B-FP8</option>
            <option>LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B</option>
            <option>Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B</option>
            <option>Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8</option>
            <option>google/gemma-4-31B-it</option>
            <option>meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct</option>
            <option>Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B</option>
            <option>Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B</option>
            <option>Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8</option>
            <option>google/gemma-4-12B-it</option>
            <option>google/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it</option>
            <option>meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B</option>
            <option>poolside/Laguna-XS-2.1</option>
            <option>mistralai/Ministral-3-14B-Reasoning-2512</option>
          </select>
          <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint llmd-launch-checkpoint-value" aria-hidden="true" data-selected-checkpoint></span>
          <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-checkpoint-hint" role="status" data-fit></span>
        </div>
        <div class="llmd-launch-field">
          <label for="llmd-launch-source">Model source</label>
          <select id="llmd-launch-source" name="source" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-source-hint">
            <option value="hub">Load at launch</option>
            <option value="download">Download first</option>
            <option value="local">Already downloaded</option>
          </select>
          <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-source-hint" data-hint></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="llmd-launch-storage">
        <div class="llmd-launch-field" data-local hidden>
          <label for="llmd-launch-directory">Host checkpoint directory</label>
          <textarea id="llmd-launch-directory" name="directory" rows="2" wrap="soft" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-required="true" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-directory-hint llmd-launch-directory-error">${HOME}/models/LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B-FP8</textarea>
          <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-directory-hint">Enter one path, such as ${HOME}/models/org/checkpoint. Omit <code>..</code> and trailing spaces.</span>
          <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-directory-error" data-field-error="directory" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </div>
        <div data-dspine hidden>
          <label class="llmd-launch-checkbox">
            <input name="dspine" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="llmd-dspine-hint" disabled> DSpine speculative decoding
          </label>
          <p class="llmd-launch-hint" id="llmd-dspine-hint">Off by default. DSpine requires LLMD 20261112.0 or later and sets batch size to 1 when enabled.</p>
          <fieldset class="llmd-launch-drafter" data-drafter-source disabled>
            <legend>Drafter source</legend>
            <label class="llmd-launch-checkbox">
              <input type="radio" name="drafterSource" value="hub" checked> Hugging Face at launch
            </label>
            <label class="llmd-launch-checkbox">
              <input type="radio" name="drafterSource" value="local" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-drafter-path"> Mount local drafter
            </label>
            <p class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-drafter-path" data-drafter-path hidden>Download the drafter from the Drafter tab or reuse an existing copy at <code data-drafter-directory></code>.</p>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="llmd-launch-options">
        <summary>Launch options</summary>
        <div class="llmd-launch-option-groups">
          <fieldset>
            <legend>Connection</legend>
            <div class="llmd-launch-options-grid">
              <div class="llmd-launch-field">
                <label for="llmd-launch-port">Host port</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-port" name="port" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="8000" aria-required="true" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-port-hint llmd-launch-port-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-port-hint">Whole number from 1 to 65535.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-port-error" data-field-error="port" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field" data-host-listener>
                <label for="llmd-launch-listen-address">Listen address (<code>--listen</code>)</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-listen-address" name="listenAddress" type="text" value="127.0.0.1" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-required="true" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-listen-address-hint llmd-launch-listen-address-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-listen-address-hint">IPv4 or IPv6 without a port, such as 127.0.0.1 or ::1. Use 0.0.0.0 to listen on all IPv4 interfaces.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-listen-address-error" data-field-error="listenAddress" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field" data-container-listener hidden>
                <label for="llmd-launch-listen-port">Container listen port (<code>--listen</code>)</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-listen-port" name="listenPort" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="8000" aria-required="true" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-listen-port-hint llmd-launch-listen-port-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-listen-port-hint">Whole number from 1 to 65535. LLMD listens on 0.0.0.0 inside Docker. Verify and Chat use the host port.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-listen-port-error" data-field-error="listenPort" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <fieldset data-docker hidden>
            <legend>Docker options</legend>
            <div class="llmd-launch-options-grid">
              <div class="llmd-launch-field">
                <label for="llmd-launch-run-mode">Run mode</label>
                <select id="llmd-launch-run-mode" name="runMode" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-run-mode-hint">
                  <option value="foreground">Foreground</option>
                  <option value="detached">Detached</option>
                </select>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-run-mode-hint">Foreground attaches to the container. Detached runs in the background.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field" data-cuda>
                <label for="llmd-launch-gpu">GPU access</label>
                <select id="llmd-launch-gpu" name="gpu" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-gpu-hint">
                  <option value="all">All GPUs</option>
                  <option value="device=0">GPU 0</option>
                </select>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-gpu-hint">Expose all CUDA GPUs or only GPU 0.</span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field">
                <label for="llmd-launch-shm">Shared memory</label>
                <select id="llmd-launch-shm" name="shm" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-shm-hint">
                  <option value="recipe">Recipe setting</option>
                  <option value="default">Docker default</option>
                  <option value="1g">1 GiB</option>
                  <option value="8g">8 GiB</option>
                  <option value="32g">32 GiB</option>
                  <option value="256g">256 GiB</option>
                </select>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-shm-hint">Use the recipe or Docker default, or choose 1, 8, 32, or 256 GiB.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <fieldset>
            <legend>LLMD overrides</legend>
            <div class="llmd-launch-options-grid">
              <div class="llmd-launch-field">
                <label for="llmd-launch-context">Context tokens</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-context" name="context" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Recipe default" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-context-hint llmd-launch-context-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-context-hint">Whole number from 1 to 4,294,967,295, or blank.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-context-error" data-field-error="context" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field" data-batch>
                <label for="llmd-launch-batch">Batch size</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-batch" name="batch" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Recipe default" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-batch-hint llmd-launch-batch-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-batch-hint">Whole number from 1 to 4,294,967,295, or blank.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-batch-error" data-field-error="batch" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field">
                <label for="llmd-launch-tokens">Token batch size</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-tokens" name="tokens" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Recipe default" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-tokens-hint llmd-launch-tokens-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-tokens-hint">Whole number from 1 to 4,294,967,295, or blank.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-tokens-error" data-field-error="tokens" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="llmd-launch-field">
                <label for="llmd-launch-memory">GPU memory fraction</label>
                <input id="llmd-launch-memory" name="memory" type="text" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Recipe default" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-memory-hint llmd-launch-memory-error">
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-hint" id="llmd-launch-memory-hint">Decimal greater than 0 and at most 1, such as 0.5, or blank.</span>
                <span class="llmd-launch-field-error" id="llmd-launch-memory-error" data-field-error="memory" aria-live="polite"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
        <div class="llmd-launch-model-options" data-hub hidden>
          <label class="llmd-launch-checkbox">
            <input name="hfToken" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="llmd-launch-token-hint"> Forward <code>HF_TOKEN</code>
          </label>
          <p class="llmd-launch-hint" id="llmd-launch-token-hint">Check to pass the host's Hugging Face token to Docker.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </form>
    <div class="llmd-launch-commands">
      <div class="llmd-launch-switch" role="group" aria-label="Quickstart commands" data-command-choices data-pagefind-ignore hidden>
        <button type="button" data-command-choice="download" aria-controls="download-checkpoint" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Download</button>
        <button type="button" data-command-choice="drafter-download" aria-controls="download-drafter" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Drafter</button>
        <button type="button" data-command-choice="launch" aria-controls="llmd-launch-steps" aria-pressed="true">Launch</button>
        <button type="button" data-command-choice="models" aria-controls="check-the-loaded-model" aria-pressed="false">Verify</button>
        <button type="button" data-command-choice="chat" aria-controls="send-a-chat-request" aria-pressed="false">Chat</button>
      </div>
      <dl class="llmd-launch-context" aria-label="Selected endpoint and model">
        <div><dt>Listening on</dt><dd><code data-endpoint>127.0.0.1:8000</code></dd></div>
        <div data-connect hidden><dt>Connect to</dt><dd><code data-client-endpoint></code></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Model ID</dt><dd><code data-expected-model-id>LFM3-1.7B-FP8</code></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="llmd-launch-error" role="status" data-error data-pagefind-ignore hidden>Correct the fields with errors to update the affected commands.</p>
      <section id="download-checkpoint" data-command-panel="download" data-pagefind-ignore hidden>
        <h2>Download checkpoint</h2>
        <p class="llmd-launch-hint">Run on the LLMD host. This requires uv and access to Hugging Face.</p>
        <div class="command-shell">
          <span class="command-language icon-code">Host shell</span>
          <pre><code class="sh" data-command="download"></code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="download-drafter" data-command-panel="drafter-download" data-pagefind-ignore hidden>
        <h2>Download DSpine drafter</h2>
        <p class="llmd-launch-hint">Download once on the LLMD host, or reuse an existing copy at this path.</p>
        <div class="command-shell">
          <span class="command-language icon-code">Host shell</span>
          <pre><code class="sh" data-command="drafter-download"></code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="llmd-launch-steps" data-command-panel="launch" aria-label="Launch commands">
        <details id="before-you-start" class="llmd-launch-requirements">
          <summary>Before you run</summary>
          <p data-requirements>Use Apple Silicon, macOS Tahoe or later, and Homebrew. Use LLMD 20261112.0 or later on M1 and M2.</p>
          <p data-tpu-requirements hidden>The <a href="https://docs.cloud.google.com/tpu/docs/run-in-container">TPU container</a> uses privileged mode and shares the VM's network. Run Verify and Chat from the TPU VM using the host port.</p>
          <p data-furiosa-requirements hidden>Set up <a href="https://developer.furiosa.ai/latest/en/cloud_native_toolkit/container.html">Furiosa container device access</a> for <code>npu0</code>. The command uses the documented unconfined seccomp option to allow the RNGD driver's <code>io_uring</code> calls.</p>
        </details>
        <div class="llmd-launch-step">
          <h2 id="install-llmd"><span class="llmd-launch-step-number">1</span> <span data-setup-title>Install LLMD</span></h2>
          <p class="llmd-launch-hint" data-setup-hint>Run once to install LLMD with Homebrew.</p>
          <div class="command-shell">
            <span class="command-language icon-code">Host shell</span>
            <pre><code class="sh" data-command="setup" data-copy-label="Copy LLMD setup command">brew install zml/zml/llmd</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="llmd-launch-step">
          <h2 id="start-the-server"><span class="llmd-launch-step-number">2</span> Start LLMD</h2>
          <p class="llmd-launch-hint" data-launch-hint>Run each time you start the server.</p>
          <div class="command-shell">
            <span class="command-language icon-code">Host shell</span>
            <pre><code class="sh" data-command="launch" data-copy-label="Copy LLMD server command">llmd --listen=127.0.0.1:8000 \
  --model=hf://LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B-FP8 \
  --model-name=LFM3-1.7B-FP8 --batch-size=4</code></pre>
          </div>
          <p class="llmd-launch-hint" data-launch-ready>Wait until LLMD finishes loading before running the verification command.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="check-the-loaded-model" data-command-panel="models">
        <h2>Check the loaded model</h2>
        <p class="llmd-launch-hint">Once LLMD finishes loading, run this in a second terminal on the host. Compare <code>data[0].id</code> with the model ID shown above.</p>
        <div class="command-shell">
          <span class="command-language icon-code">Host shell</span>
          <pre><code class="sh" data-command="models">curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/models</code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="send-a-chat-request" data-command-panel="chat">
        <h2>Send a chat request</h2>
        <p class="llmd-launch-hint">Run this after verification. Look for the reply in <code>choices[0].message.content</code>.</p>
        <div class="command-shell">
          <span class="command-language icon-code">Host shell</span>
          <pre><code class="sh" data-command="chat">curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"model":"LFM3-1.7B-FP8","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Reply with one short greeting."}]}'</code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

# [Checkpoint storage]($heading.id('checkpoint-storage'))

- **Load at launch** reads the checkpoint from Hugging Face when LLMD starts.
- **Download first** generates a **Download** command for the selected checkpoint.
  Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/) on the LLMD
  host, then run **Download** before **Launch**. The default directory is
  `${HOME}/models/<org>/<checkpoint>`.
- **Already downloaded** uses the existing **Host checkpoint directory**. The
  launch command mounts it read-only at `/model` in Docker or passes its path
  directly to a native LLMD installation.

For either local option, select the directory containing `config.json`. Keep
the tokenizer, Safetensors weights, any weight index and shards, and any
provided chat template or generation settings together from the same revision.
To pin a download, add `--revision <commit>` to the generated download command
and use a separate directory for that revision.

## [Gated checkpoints]($heading.id('gated-checkpoints'))

Request access on the Hugging Face model page and export `HF_TOKEN` with read
access. For a download, `uvx --from huggingface_hub hf auth login` can also
save the token on the host. To load from Hugging Face at launch in Docker,
enable **Forward HF_TOKEN** under **Launch options**. See
[Model storage and credentials]($link.page('reference/environment').ref('model-storage-and-credentials'))
for token lookup and how to pin a Hugging Face revision at launch.

## [S3 or Google Cloud Storage]($heading.id('cloud-checkpoints'))

Keep the complete checkpoint under one bucket prefix. Choose **Load at launch**,
then replace `--model` in the generated launch command with
`--model=s3://my-bucket/llm/checkpoint` or `--model=gs://my-bucket/llm/checkpoint`.
Configure credentials for the process that runs LLMD. See
[Model storage and credentials]($link.page('reference/environment').ref('model-storage-and-credentials'))
and [passing variables and credential files to Docker]($link.page('reference/environment').ref('pass-variables-to-docker')).

# [Troubleshooting]($heading.id('troubleshooting'))

- **The connection is refused.** Check the startup output for model access,
  compilation, or memory errors. Retry Verify once LLMD starts listening.
- **The port is in use.** Change Host port in Launch options. Verify and Chat
  use the same port.
- **The request fails.** Compare the ID returned by Verify with the model ID
  in Chat.
- **LLMD runs out of memory.** Check the checkpoint and accelerator
  [requirements]($link.page('reference/compatibility')). Try a smaller
  checkpoint or reduce batch size in Launch options.

# [Next steps]($heading.id('next-steps'))

- [Use the LLMD API]($link.page('llmd/api')) for streaming, tools, and request options.
- [Deploy and verify an LLMD service]($link.page('operations/deployment')).
